  "overviews": {
    "zh-CN": "提供 XML 文件的解析、生成、查询（XPath）和转换（XSLT）能力。支持 DOM 和 SAX 解析模式、命名空间处理、DTD/Schema 验证等功能。",
    "en-US": "XML parsing, generation, XPath queries, and XSLT transformation. Supports DOM and SAX parsing, namespace handling, and DTD/Schema validation.",
    "zh-TW": "提供 XML 檔案的解析、生成、查询（XPath）和轉换（XSLT）能力。支援 DOM 和 SAX 解析模式、命名空间處理、DTD/Schema 驗證等功能。",
    "ja": "XMLの解析・生成・XPathクエリ・XSLT変換。DOM/SAXパース・名前空間・DTD/Schema検証対応。",
    "ko": "XML 파싱, 생성, XPath 쿼리, XSLT 변환. DOM/SAX 파싱, 네임스페이스, DTD/Schema 검증 지원.",
    "es": "Análisis, generación, XPath y XSLT de XML. DOM/SAX, espacios de nombres y validación DTD/Schema.",
    "fr": "Analyse, génération, XPath et XSLT XML. DOM/SAX, espaces de noms et validation DTD/Schema.",
    "de": "XML-Parsing, -Erzeugung, XPath und XSLT. DOM/SAX, Namespaces und DTD/Schema-Validierung.",
    "pt-BR": "Parsing, geração, XPath e XSLT XML. DOM/SAX, namespaces e validação DTD/Schema.",
    "ru": "Парсинг, генерация, XPath и XSLT XML. DOM/SAX, пространства имён и валидация DTD/Schema.",
    "ar": "تحليل وإنشاء XML واستعلامات XPath وتحويل XSLT. DOM/SAX ومساحات أسماء والتحقق DTD/Schema.",
    "hi": "XML पार्सिंग, जनरेशन, XPath और XSLT। DOM/SAX, नेमस्पेस और DTD/Schema वैलिडेशन।"
  },
